100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/Item_building-12724.png/150px-Item_building-12724.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/Item_building-12724.png/200px-Item_building-12724.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%91%E8%8D%92%E5%8E%9F/%E6%B3%A2%E6%B5%AA%E4%B9%8B%E5%AE%B6\" title=\"不休荒原/波浪之家\">波浪之家</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">海洋与曲线是自然的奇迹，对于以人力在陆地上将其复现的行为——我们称之为艺术。</span></span></span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">技能1</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">技能2</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3109/310903/技能1.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3109/310903/技能1 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3109/310903/技能2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3109/310903/技能2 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3109/310903/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3109/310903/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3109/310903/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3109/310903/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"310903\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-310904.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b7/Belonging-310904.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“曲线的舞蹈”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Dance of the Curving Ribbons\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />9.2<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>从白浪与水波间，设计师小心地截取了一段自然的诗篇，作为这套服装中不可或缺的点缀。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-310905.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/7/73/Belonging-310905.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“海洋的脊骨”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Spine of the Ocean\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一串缀满贝壳的珠链，如同从海中打捞起的椎骨。受访者所珍重的努库泰澳贝壳也被串入其中，在反复确认染料不会损伤贝壳后，受访者同意了将象形文字改描为蓝色的拍摄需求。“这还挺新奇的，像是为它们穿上了新衣服。”</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-310906.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/f2/Belonging-310906.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“巴特罗海浪”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"The Waves of Casa Batlló\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />81<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>手工缝制的多层衬裙，布料轻柔、绵软，多层叠加后略有些沉重。受访者多次表示了对这条衬裙的喜爱，尽管她将其描述为：“它让我有点迈不开腿……就像在海浪里行走。噢，我很怀念这种感觉。”</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%9B%B2%E7%BA%BF%E7%9A%84%E5%B1%85%E6%89%801.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 曲线的居所1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%9B%B2%E7%BA%BF%E7%9A%84%E5%B1%85%E6%89%801.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%9B%B2%E7%BA%BF%E7%9A%84%E5%B1%85%E6%89%801.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%9B%B2%E7%BA%BF%E7%9A%84%E5%B1%85%E6%89%801.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%9B%B2%E7%BA%BF%E7%9A%84%E5%B1%85%E6%89%801.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%9B%B2%E7%BA%BF%E7%9A%84%E5%B1%85%E6%89%801.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%9B%B2%E7%BA%BF%E7%9A%84%E5%B1%85%E6%89%801.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%9B%B2%E7%BA%BF%E7%9A%84%E5%B1%85%E6%89%802.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 曲线的居所2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%9B%B2%E7%BA%BF%E7%9A%84%E5%B1%85%E6%89%802.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%9B%B2%E7%BA%BF%E7%9A%84%E5%B1%85%E6%89%802.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%9B%B2%E7%BA%BF%E7%9A%84%E5%B1%85%E6%89%802.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%9B%B2%E7%BA%BF%E7%9A%84%E5%B1%85%E6%89%802.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%9B%B2%E7%BA%BF%E7%9A%84%E5%B1%85%E6%89%802.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%9B%B2%E7%BA%BF%E7%9A%84%E5%B1%85%E6%89%802.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">曲线的居所 <small style=\"color: grey\">Casa of the Curved Lines</small></span></span>"}}